# Phase 18z14-ii -- the design-based footer sentence (ruling Q7), replacing z14-i's
# "Weighted by the survey design." now that the intervals account for the design too.
msgid ""
"Design-based (survey): weighted estimates, intervals and tests account for "
"the sample design."
msgstr ""
"Fondé sur le plan de sondage (survey) : estimations, intervalles et tests "
"pondérés tiennent compte du plan d'échantillonnage."

msgid ""
"Design-based (survey) estimates; this table's design variance could not be "
"computed, so its intervals account for the weighting only."
msgstr ""
"Estimations fondées sur le plan de sondage (survey) ; la variance du plan "
"n'a pas pu être calculée pour ce tableau : les intervalles ne tiennent "
"compte que de la pondération."

# Phase 18z14-ii -- the design-based footer sentence (ruling Q7), replacing z14-i's
# "Weighted by the survey design." now that the intervals account for the design too.
msgid ""
"Weighted by %s; confidence intervals and tests account for the weighting."
msgstr ""
"Pondéré par %s ; les intervalles de confiance et les tests tiennent compte "
"de la pondération."

msgid ""
"Weighted by %s; confidence intervals and tests use the unweighted sample "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Pondéré par %s ; les intervalles de confiance et les tests utilisent "
"l'effectif non pondéré."

